        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>应届生身份常见问题解答</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    padding:14px 18px 24px 18px;\n    background:#ffffff;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n    color:#1a1a1a;\n    max-width:560px;\n  }\n  .title{\n    position:relative;\n    font-size:34px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n    text-align:center;\n    margin:4px 0 16px 0;\n    padding-bottom:8px;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .title .circled{\n    display:inline-block;\n    padding:2px 10px;\n    border:2.5px solid #e03030;\n    border-radius:50%/50%;\n  }\n  .title .underline{\n    display:block;\n    height:6px;\n    width:78%;\n    margin:6px auto 0 auto;\n    border-radius:4px;\n    background:#f2a13c;\n    opacity:.85;\n  }\n  .qa{margin-bottom:16px;}\n  .q{\n    font-size:19px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    margin:0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .a{\n    font-size:19px;\n    line-height:1.6;\n    margin:0;\n  }\n  .num{\n    display:inline-block;\n    border:1.5px solid #7fbf7f;\n    background:#eaf5e2;\n    color:#3a6b3a;\n    font-size:15px;\n    width:19px;\n    height:19px;\n    line-height:19px;\n    text-align:center;\n    margin-right:5px;\n    vertical-align:2px;\n  }\n  .hl-green{background:#e6efd8;padding:0 2px;}\n  .box-orange{\n    border:2px solid #f0952f;\n    border-radius:9px;\n    padding:0 4px;\n    background:#fdf3e2;\n  }\n  .u-purple{\n    border-bottom:2.5px solid #b070e0;\n    padding-bottom:1px;\n  }\n  .u-black{\n    border-bottom:1.5px solid #333;\n    padding-bottom:1px;\n  }\n  .marknum{\n    color:#c05a9a;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .star{\n    color:#b070e0;\n    font-size:22px;\n    margin-left:6px;\n  }\n  .circle-num{\n    display:inline-block;\n    border:1.5px solid #b070e0;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    color:#b070e0;\n    width:18px;height:18px;line-height:18px;\n    text-align:center;font-size:12px;\n    vertical-align:6px;\n  }\n  .placeholder{\n    display:inline-block;\n    color:#b070e0;\n    font-size:13px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"circled\">应届生</span>身份常见问题解答\n  <span class=\"underline\"></span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"qa\">\n  <p class=\"q\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>在读期间交了<span class=\"box-orange\">社保</span><span class=\"hl-green\">算应届生吗？</span></p>\n  <p class=\"a\">算。<span class=\"u-purple\">在读期间实习交的社保不影响毕业应届生身份认定</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"qa\">\n  <p class=\"q\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>寒暑假期间实习，公司交了<span class=\"box-orange\">社保</span><span class=\"hl-green\">算应届生吗？</span><span class=\"star\">✩</span></p>\n  <p class=\"a\">算。属于在读期间（非毕业找工作期间）缴纳的都不影<br>响应届生身份认定。</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"qa\">\n  <p class=\"q\"><span class=\"num\">3</span>兼取时交了<span class=\"box-orange\">工伤保险</span><span class=\"hl-green\">影响应届生身份吗？</span></p>\n  <p class=\"a\">不影响。还是有应届生身份的。</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"qa\">\n  <p class=\"q\"><span class=\"num\">4</span>毕业签了三方还是应届生吗？</p>\n  <p class=\"a\"><span class=\"u-black\">算。毕业后没有缴纳社保，处于择业期内算应届毕业生</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"qa\">\n  <p class=\"q\"><span class=\"num\">5</span>应届生身份什么时候失效？</p>\n  <p class=\"a\"><span class=\"u-purple\">一是毕业以后缴纳了社保，二是超过两年择业期。</span> <span class=\"circle-num\">2</span></p>\n  <p class=\"a\" style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:150px;\"><span class=\"marknum\">①</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"qa\">\n  <p class=\"q\"><span class=\"num\">6</span>虽然毕业了但是公司没有交<span class=\"box-orange\">社保</span><span class=\"hl-green\">算吗？</span></p>\n  <p class=\"a\">处于两年择业期的话，是算的。</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"qa\">\n  <p class=\"q\"><span class=\"num\">7</span>在找工作 签了<span class=\"box-orange\">三方协议</span>和<span class=\"box-orange\">劳动合同</span><span class=\"hl-green\">还算应届生吗？</span></p>\n  <p class=\"a\">不算。三方协议不算正式的劳动合同，但签定了正式的<br>\n  <span class=\"u-purple\">劳动合同就不算应届毕业生了。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"a\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"star\">✩</span></p>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
